 y = new HashSet<>();\n\n        // Recursive function to generate subset sums\n        class SubsetSumGenerator {\n            void generate(Set<Integer> set, int[] arr, int index, int limit, int sum) {\n                if (index == limit) {\n                    set.add(sum);\n                } else {\n                    generate(set, arr, index + 1, limit, (sum + arr[index]) % m);\n                    generate(set, arr, index + 1, limit, sum);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        int h = n / 2;\n        SubsetSumGenerator generator = new SubsetSumGenerator();\n        generator.generate(x, a, 0, h, 0);\n        generator.generate(y, a, h, n, 0);\n\n        List<Integer> yList = new ArrayList<>(y);\n        Collections.sort(yList);\n\n        int maxSum = 0;\n        for (int i : x) {\n            int target = m - i;\n            int idx = Collections.binarySearch(yList, target);\n            if (idx < 0) {\n                idx = -idx - 1;\n            }\n            if (idx > 0) {\n                int candidate = i + yList.get(idx - 1);\n                if (candidate > maxSum) {\n                    maxSum = candidate;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        System.out.println(maxSum);\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.9\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.0008207073551602662, -0.000206401280593127, -3.128163257315464e-07, -1.9862216504407115e-05, -3.054500666621607e-06, -3.128163257315464e-07, -2.15310683415737e-05, -0.05722993239760399, -0.1802665740251541, -6.749814019713085e-06, -0.023273667320609093, -0.0005922323907725513, -2.45848218582978e-06, -3.128163257315464e-07, -0.0003049570368602872, -0.00193458900321275, -0.0001544321421533823, -0.004657968878746033, 0.0, -2.939851037808694e-05, -7.896309739408025e-07, -1.2471589798224159e-05, -1.2664456789934775e-06, -4.320199877838604e-07, -8.637786231702194e-05, -0.12702354788780212, -0.00029995047952979803, -0.00012248923303559422, -6.704273118884885e-07, -0.005